 Data: Financial Modeling Prep ; Chart: George Moriarty/Axios 😱 Tech stocks plunged today in the most visible sign yet that investors are growing worried about a slowdown in the AI boom. The Nasdaq was down about 5% as of midafternoon. Get the latest . 🗳️ Nithya Raman, a little-known L.A. City Council member backed by the Democratic Socialists of America, has defeated Mayor Karen Bass — an upset that will alter the trajectory of the nation's second largest city. Go deeper . 🚁 Drone delivery service Zipline raised $1.5 billion at a $21.5 billion valuation and expanded its Walmart partnership. More from Dan Primack . ⛳️ LIV Golf is officially shutting down, with attorneys telling a bankruptcy court that the PGA Tour rival would transition from restructuring to liquidation. Go deeper . 
 
