 4. ⚽️ 1 sports thing: Ronaldo done with Portugal 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Cristiano Ronaldo after Portugal's 1-0 loss to Spain in the 2026 FIFA World Cup. Photo: Ryan Pierse/FIFA via Getty Images Soccer legend Cristiano Ronaldo will no longer play for Portugal, ending an international career that spanned six World Cups, a European title and the men's all-time international scoring record.

 His departure follows a high-profile falling-out with Portugal coach Jorge Jesus. 🇵🇹 The 41-year-old Ronaldo said on Instagram : "To the Portuguese people, the day has come for me to hand back the No. 7 shirt of our national team."

 "It was not an easy decision, because some decisions are not made with the mind alone. They are also made with the heart." Go deeper . 

 
 
